{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by virtue of the size, height, sitting and appearance; would be inappropriate and unacceptable in the context of surrounding development and would be detrimental to the street scene, result in over proliferation of advertising structures in the locality and in turn harmful to local visual amenity as well as residential amenity to the nearby neighbours detriment to their living conditions, contrary to NPPF, London Plan policies D4, D8, T1, T2 and Local Plan policies CC1, CC2, CC5 and EC1.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal, incorporating two large illuminated digital advertisements would represent potential distraction to motorists, to the detriment of the safety and free flow of traffic and the interest of public safety contrary to NPPF, London Plan policies D4, D8, T1, T2 and Local Plan policies CC1, CC2, CC5 and EC1."
